<title>USA: Atlantic Coast Airlines names Tate CFO.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Coast Airlines names Tate CFO.</headline>
<dateline>STERLING, Va. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlantic Coast Airlines said it hired Paul Tate as its chief financial officer to replace Jim Glennon, who left the company to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Tate had been with Reno Air Inc since 1993, where he was chief financial officer.  He has over 17 years of airline experience, the company said.</p>
